"<b>Note:</b> commissions will be paid by a manager according to our internal "
"schedule."
msgstr ""
"<b>Nota:</b> las comisiones serán pagadas por un gestor según nuestro "
"calendario interno."

#: includes/abstracts/class-yith-wcaf-abstract-dashboard.php:407
